{"ratings":[{"id":"C1","consequence":"diag","trigger":"plausible","reason":"Thinking messages longer than 2,000 characters lose their tail in the owner diagnostic copy, limiting diagnostic detail."},{"id":"C2","consequence":"boundary","trigger":"plausible","reason":"After a rollback, agents can read retained owner-only diagnostics because the previous release lacks the new database read restrictions."},{"id":"C3","consequence":"nuisance","trigger":"plausible","reason":"Cleanup can cause a diagnostic ID to be reused behind a follow cursor, omitting it from the live display even though it remains available in later queries."},{"id":"C4","consequence":"secret","trigger":"plausible","reason":"A preview build script can read owner-only diagnostics and expose their private contents through a public failure summary."}]}